    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>ATD Dashboard Quick Notes adds a dedicated widget to your WordPress admin dashboard, allowing administrators to seamlessly save temporary notes, ideas, or to-do lists. Built with standard WordPress security measures (Nonces and Capability Checks) and utilizes AJAX for a fast, refresh-free experience.</p>\n",
        "installation": "<ol>\n<li>Upload the plugin folder to the <code>/wp-content/plugins/</code> directory.</li>\n<li>Activate the plugin through the &#8216;Plugins&#8217; menu in WordPress.</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.2.4</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Fixed: Balanced editor buttons toolbar to stay in 2 rows cleanly.</li>\n<li>Added: Crypto and Binance Pay donation support for developer tips.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.2.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Initial release. Secure AJAX-based quick notes widget.</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "A secure, lightweight dashboard widget to write down quick notes and tasks directly inside the WordPress admin panel.",
